architecture-beta
align row client api queue
group platform(cloud)[Platform]
group app(server)[Applications] in platform
group data(database)[Data] in platform
group partner(cloud)[Partner]
service queue(database)[Queue] in data
service client(server)[Client] in app
service api(server)[API] in app
service worker(server)[Worker] in app
service audit(database)[Audit] in data
service remote(cloud)[Remote] in partner
junction bus in data
client:R --> L:api
api:R --> L:queue
queue:B --> T:bus
bus{group}:R --> L:remote
align column api worker
align column queue audit bus
align row worker audit remote
align row client api queue
